Dandy lions?

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.620
Lion dandies!

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:45.700
Lion dandies?

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.290
Don't see any lion dandies.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.830
I have no idea which plants we can eat.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.160
