00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:56.870
Try it and find out.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:58.370
No.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.500
Sat-chan, let us know if you find anything

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.500
other than dandelions, okay?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.410
Lion dandies!

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.750
I feel like I see Trifolium repens a lot.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.500
Trifolium repens?

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.700
What does THAT look like?

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.250
Clover.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.700
Familiar Plants

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.700
Eating Plants

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.580
You can eat clovers?

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:18.830
Probably.

