00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:22.330
Yui, Koto-chan, look at this!

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.200
What is it? Did you find something?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.450
These blue flowers, and this!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.950
I think they're the same!

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.660
You're right, they DO look the same!

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.450
Right?

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.410
We can eat these, too?

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.160
It's dayflower!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.580
That's an edible plant!

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.830
These are edible? That's so strange!

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.750
It IS strange!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.040
Okay, let's get some!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.410
Not the most careful harvest.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.040
But HOW do we eat them?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.500
When we've gathered them up,

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.500
we'll put them all together and boil them.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.540
I'll bring a stove from my house.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.080
Great idea!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.750
Okay! We'll look for everything we can

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.750
until we find some lion dandies!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:04.700
Lion dandies!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.500
Dandelions!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.250
Dandelions!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.370
Dandy lions...

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:13.700
Lion dandies!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.290
Lion dandies!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.160
Lindy-lion.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.620
I found some Trifolium repens.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.580
What? Really?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.200
See? That's Trifolium repens.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.120
So this is edible, too.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.620
She's right! It says so right here!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:34.910
Told ya.

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:36.040
Let's get some!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.660
Not the most careful harvest.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.370
I want to pick some, too!

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.410
Okay, I'll go get the stove.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.290
When you find the lion dandies,

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.290
wash them while you wait for me to get back.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.290
Okay!

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.950
Let's definitely find some before Kotoha gets back!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.660
Yeah! Time for Lion Dandy Search Mode: Hyper!

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.250
Yellow-Only Focus Mode!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.160
Oh, I like that! I'll do it, too!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.200
Yellow-Only Focus Mode!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.450
Did you find something?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.450
It's Sat-chan!

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.250
Oh, no!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.040
One more time. Yellow-Only Focus Mode!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.120
Did you find something?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.040
It's Sat-chan!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.950
Oh, no!

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.950
Yellow-Only Focus Mode!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.080
Give it a rest.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.700
Awww!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.080
Huh? Koto-chan?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.290
Oh, Nonoka.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.450
Is that a pot?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.870
Yup.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.830
And dried squid?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.450
Yup.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.040
Man, we're not finding ANY lion dandies.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:10.660
Maybe there aren't any lion dandies in this park.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.120
I was sure I saw some before.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.950
Fine. This calls for...

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.290
Lion Dandy Search Mode: Z!

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.450
Wow, that looks powerful!

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.450
Changed Perspective Mode!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.040
I found the lion dandies!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.410
Really?

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.660
They weren't yellow!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.370
They're all fuzzy!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.160
Okay, time to pick 'em!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.080
Not the most careful harvest.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.410
Huh? What?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.370
Did you find any dandelions?

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.080
They were fuzzy!

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.290
You ate something on the way here!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.500
No. I ate nothing.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.410
Come on, let's boil 'em!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.040
Yeah!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.000
Yeah.

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.000
Yeah!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.000
Is it ready yet? Is it ready yet?

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.700
I've never eaten something I picked myself before.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.000
Okay, let's open it up!

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.330
It stinks.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.660
Yeah.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.700
Rock-paper-scissors. Loser eats it.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:49.620
That makes it sound like a bad thing.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:53.870
Of all the weeds in the world,

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:53.870
there are only a few that we can eat.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.250
It smells bad, but I bet it tastes good!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.500
You might be right!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.290
Okay, then I'll eat the dandelion!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.250
I'll eat the Trifolium repens!

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:11.950
I'll eat the dayflower.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.540
We'll all eat on three.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.660
One, two, three!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.910
Gross.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.700
Tastes likes grass.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.410
Like grass.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:27.580
Grass.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.080
You snot-nosed brats!

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.870
You can't cook here!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.660
No fire allowed! Put that out!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.330
Weedy grass.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.830
Yeah, weedy grass.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.910
Weedy grass...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.000
This is the most depressing hot pot party I've ever seen!

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:57.080
Colors

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.700
Yui...

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.620
She's a crybaby.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.370
I'm not a crybaby!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.620
You never realized?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.750
You don't have enough dignity as our leader.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Sleep

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Search for

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
wild plants

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Don the

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Vanquish

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
cabrilla

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
ghosts

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Weakness

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.700
Identification Meeting 

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.120
Dignity?

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.870
I have dignity.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.750
I do so have dignity.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.700
I'm the leader.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.040
I'm the leader!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.870
See? You're crying.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.910
Okay, okay. I'll give you some dignity merch.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.200
Pardon me a sec.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.370
Dignity merch?

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.700
Out of the way, Colonel.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.120
I'm pretty sure it's in here.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.750
Here it is!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.910
Does it bring out my dignity?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.290
Mission failed.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.620
Ugh, Sat-chan! You dummy, dummy, dummy!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:54.950
There it is!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.830
Put those wrinkles between your eyebrows,

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.830
just like that.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.500
L-like this?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.120
Now say, "I'm the leader, bub!"

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.250
I'm the leader, bub!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.620
Mission failed.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.330
Dummy!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.870
But let's just keep it on for now, to see how it works out.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.750
Huh?!

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.750
Okay.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.410
Okay, bub!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.330
So next we're looking for Sat-chan's weakness.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:22.620
Me?

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.120
I already know.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.290
I know my weakness.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:31.870
I've always known.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.330
I'm just too cute!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.660
Th-that was mean, Koto-chan!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:47.450
I just figured, if you're too cute, I should fix the problem.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.330
You went there, huh?

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.160
Do I have a face?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.000
Yes, but...

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:57.620
Oh, Sat-chan, you just do too many stupid things.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:00.700
That's your weakness.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.620
It's fun to be stupid!

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.330
You're too optimistic!

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.870
I love that about you, Sat-chan. Er...

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.120
I love that, bub!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.540
Okay, finally... Kotoha's weakness!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:13.620
Me?

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.750
Koto-chan, eh?

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.330
Her weakness is, you know.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:22.000
If she falls from a high place, she'll break a bone.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.200
That's true of everyone.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.580
Oh yeah!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.000
What IS my weakness? Think.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.250
I know what it is. You see...

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:35.750
Wait!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.750
Wait a minute, Yui!

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:38.750
Huh?

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.120
Well, it's just... I mean...

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.500
It's not something that's better left unsaid, is it?

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.950
What do you mean, "better left unsaid"? Is it a secret?

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:52.500
No!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.870
Um, I mean...

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:58.290
Yui, tell me! No secrets!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.250
Huh? Okay.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.160
You see, your weakness is...

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.120
you're bad at video games.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.500
Um, Leader.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.620
Can I talk to you?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.830
I think that's something

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.830
you shouldn't really say very much.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.660
What? But we're having a

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.660
weakness identification meeting.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.200
We have to be honest.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.410
Kotoha IS bad at video games.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:48.200
Oh, I mean!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.660
She's bad at them, bub!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.950
I... I am not!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:58.120
I-I'm playing games all the time.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:58.120
I couldn't possibly be bad at them.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.450
Sat-chan! Sat-chan, say something!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.330
Don't try to spare my feelings! It's not like you!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.450
Koto-chan.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:12.450
What?!

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.290
You're always mashing the buttons

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.290
when it won't do anything.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.450
NO!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.040
Admit it, Kotoha, bub!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.200
You're not good at video games, bub!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.160
None of your dignity!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:36.290
Oh, what's wrong? You love something

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:36.290
that you're not good at, Koto-chan, and for that...

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.000
...we love you!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.040
Don't talk in stereo!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.080
Forget it. 

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.160
I don't want to hear anymore.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.790
Don't try to cheer me up.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.870
Koto-chan's crying!

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.790
Cheer up, Kotoha!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:54.040
I know! You can borrow this!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:59.160
Colors

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.870
Note: Saigo Takamori is known for being one of the last great samurai.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.870
I wonder why they made Saigo-san into a statue.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.580
Oh, we just learned about that in school!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.870
Right, Koto-chan?

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.370
