00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.410
That can't be why!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.120
Do you remember, Kotoha?

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.450
I do.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.620
Note: "Saigo Tosatsu," or "Saigo Covert Photography," is a book about a

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.620
samurai-turned-photographer on a mission to take a secret photo of Saigo Takamori.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.540
Pretty sure it was covert photography.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.330
That can't be why, either!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.250
Look carefully at Saigo-san's face, Yui!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.950
Doesn't he look like someone

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.950
