00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:05.160
He does not...

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:06.830
I think.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.620
And that dog next to him.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.290
It's a dog-shaped camera!

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:15.580
What kind of a camera is shaped like a dog?

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.250
Oh, I got it!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.950
I just had an idea!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.330
Ameyoko

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.450
Pops! Pops, are you there?

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.370
Pops...

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.410
Note: Gangs of kids in the 1990s would go around

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.410
