00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.950
Oh, Colors!

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.370
Hey, you!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.790
What belongs to Pops belongs to Colors!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:39.200
Colors, you should stop by later

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:39.200
