00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.750
Oh, we will!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.200
I guess I could be bothered.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.450
Okay! You can hunt this pops if you want.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.620
Come on, rescue me.

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:48.200
What's with the mustache?

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.080
Silence, knave.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.450
It's for dignity. It's dignified.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.000
Dignity?

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:00.160
Alright, Kujiraoka-san. This Friday, okay?

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.080
Yeah.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.290
Catch you later, Colors.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.540
Bye!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.290
I'll be waiting.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.000
Bye-bye!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.410
