00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.500
I dunno.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:14.750
But if you take all kinds of pictures,

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:14.750
at least one of them should have something amazing.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.120
Okay, but if we DON'T get an amazing picture, 

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.790
then we get to take a picture of you

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.790
without your sunglasses!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:20.950
What?!

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:22.700
Oh! I like that idea!

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.160
Agreed.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:28.330
Fine. I expect some great photos.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.500
Here we go!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.200
Leader, stop!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.330
Nice work, Colonel!

